*======================================================================
* txaprobe.a99 - M0 build: the probe at >A000, the kernel at >2000.
*
* Assembled by tools/build.py into E/A option 5 files and a cartridge.
* xas99 writes the E/A 5 files in address order, and E/A starts a
* program at its first file's load address, so the kernel at >2000
* opens with the jump to the program (KENTRY).  The cartridge loader
* jumps to >2000 too.
*======================================================================
       COPY "macros.a99"
       COPY "defs.a99"

       AORG >A000
       COPY "probe.a99"
* PROGND: first free byte of the resident window
PROGND

       AORG >2000
KENTRY B    @START             the entry: E/A 5 and the cartridge start here
       COPY "vdp.a99"
       COPY "f18a.a99"
       COPY "pager.a99"
       COPY "keys.a99"
       COPY "text80.a99"
       COPY "rle.a99"
* KERNND: first free byte of the kernel window
KERNND
       END  START
